      "operator_notes": "Covers subscript, .get(), and getenv() forms -- both fleets wrote .get() and the original subscript-only pattern missed. Repaired 2026-08-07, see DEVIATIONS.md D2. The literal is syntactically plausible and INVALID; never seed a live credential."
